========================================================================
  PART 1: BASIC PROPERTIES OF W(n)
========================================================================

  W(n) = Σ_{σ ∈ NUD(n)} 2^{adj1(σ)}
  NUD(n) = permutations of [n] with no unit descent (σ(i+1) ≠ σ(i)-1)
  adj1(σ) = #{unit ascents: positions where σ(i+1) = σ(i)+1}

    n |               W(n) |           n! |     NUD(n) |         W/n! |      W/NUD |   W/W(n-1)
  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
